#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM"
