msgstr "Maybe if I flapped it really fast I could get off the ground."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.VENOMGLAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.VENOMGLAND"
