msgstr "Hope this comes in handy. Otherwise that flytrap died for nothing."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.VINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.VINE"
