msgstr "How adorable. They think they're people!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_TUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_TUSK"
