msgstr "Big deal, it's a tooth. I have a bunch of them in my mouth."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNING"
