msgstr "Someone's obviously jealous of my keen fashion sense."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNT"
